{"4483210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Too-Cute Girl Who Moved in Next Door", "steam_appid": 4483210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4985470, 5009070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>3D romance simulation game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world using point-and-click controls to move, investigate locations, and interact with the heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing a variety of <strong>missions and mini-games</strong>, you can earn money and gradually build your relationship by increasing the heroine’s <strong>affection and trust</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Pure Romance Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an act of revenge slowly changes into something more.<br>As Yuki spends time with Keiko, he gradually finds himself falling for her.<br>Keiko, too, becomes unable to suppress her growing feelings through their interactions.<br>Confess your love and work toward marriage.<br>This is the game’s main storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Revenge Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce Keiko to a new part-time job in the nightlife industry. <br>Record key moments of her new life and compile them into a video message. <br>Send it as a final statement to the former boss you despise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/102f64ed6048cd142f0ef9df9839cb13.poster.avif?t=1788013274\" width=706 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/102f64ed6048cd142f0ef9df9839cb13.webm?t=1788013274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/102f64ed6048cd142f0ef9df9839cb13.mp4?t=1788013274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events related to the main heroine will occur</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your affection or love rating will increase depending on your choices during the drama</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Be warned - making wrong choices will raise your criminal coefficient...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are many mini-games available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some help you earn money, while others boost your affection or love ratings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raising your affection or love ratings through these will advance the main story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/171d2f6b8d1315c5fa6b40832ff871b2.poster.avif?t=1788013274\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/171d2f6b8d1315c5fa6b40832ff871b2.webm?t=1788013274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/171d2f6b8d1315c5fa6b40832ff871b2.mp4?t=1788013274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/2517d2633ddc61ae3591e2efd9872d0a.avif?t=1788013274\" width=460 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/5c099115bb1fa673dd988129a381a84d.avif?t=1788013274\" width=460 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483210/extras/0c289e416bbc5d812deaeab84